{"ID":"20240506100122-9y2y0np","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100122-9y2y0np","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100122-9y2y0np\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100122-98r8u6r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100122-98r8u6r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100122-98r8u6r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"253葱实","type":"doc","updated":"20240822090538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627150239-go0kier","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627150239-go0kier","updated":"20240822090105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 400px;","style":"width: 390px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葱实2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葱实2-20240627150239-wm2xan1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 390px;\" parent-style=\"width: 400px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822090457-gjdhjkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822090457-gjdhjkh","updated":"20240822090457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 738px;","style":"width: 728px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葱 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葱 1-20240822090331-sgv22eu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 728px;\" parent-style=\"width: 738px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627145928-kkbjz7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627145928-kkbjz7g","updated":"20240822090122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 436px;","style":"width: 426px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葱实5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葱实5-20240627150420-oxp1l2x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 426px;\" parent-style=\"width: 436px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 532px;","style":"width: 522px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葱实"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葱实-20240627145928-s7w90d2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 522px;\" parent-style=\"width: 532px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 289px;","style":"width: 279px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葱实3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葱实3-20240627150107-b5f7u7o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 279px;\" parent-style=\"width: 289px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240822090242-myiguzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822090242-myiguzl","updated":"20240822090452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 343px;","style":"width: 333px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葱"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葱-20240822090242-fa8isl0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 333px;\" parent-style=\"width: 343px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葱 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葱 2-20240822090442-e8e6byb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 384px;","style":"width: 374px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葱实7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葱实7-20240627150607-fh4xluj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 374px;\" parent-style=\"width: 384px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240627150631-3wgya48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627150631-3wgya48","updated":"20240822090538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 883px;","style":"width: 873px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627150631-mzmkhgh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 873px;\" parent-style=\"width: 883px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 374px;","style":"width: 364px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"葱 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/葱 3-20240822090538-2a6yym2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 364px;\" parent-style=\"width: 374px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612152838-nuqs98p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612152838-nuqs98p"}},{"ID":"20240612152931-2w85evt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612152931-2w85evt","updated":"20240612152936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱实《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612152931-8h20fq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152931-8h20fq0","updated":"20240612152931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152931-0std9ha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152931-0std9ha","updated":"20240612152931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主明目补中不足，其茎可作汤，主伤寒寒热，出汗，中风面目肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152931-nc2unu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152931-nc2unu7","updated":"20240612152931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（左上占左下贝右上又右下韭），味辛温。主金创，创败，轻身不饥耐老。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152931-j9xh5rz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152931-j9xh5rz","updated":"20240612152931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生鲁山。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152931-417si2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152931-417si2f","updated":"20240612152931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：（左上占左下贝右上又右下韭）菜也，叶似韭。《广雅》云：韭、（左上占左下贝右上又右下韭）、荞，其华谓之菁。《尔雅》云：（左上占左下贝右上又右下韭）、鸿荟。郭璞云：即（左上占左下贝右上又右下韭）菜也，又劲山贲。陶宏景云：葱（左上占左下贝右上又右下韭）异物，而今共条，本经既无韭，以其同类，故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153139-vy5812q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153139-vy5812q"}},{"ID":"20240612153140-xun6tdr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153140-xun6tdr","updated":"20240612153144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱实《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153140-jttml70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153140-jttml70","updated":"20240612153140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主明目，补中不足，其茎葱白∶平。可作汤。主伤寒寒热，出汗，中风，面目肿，伤寒骨肉痛，喉痹不通，安胎，归于目，除肝邪气，安中，利五脏，益目睛，杀百药毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153127-yxyyuam","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153127-yxyyuam"}},{"ID":"20240612153128-ranxi8p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153128-ranxi8p","updated":"20240612153133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱实《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153128-nat130q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153128-nat130q","updated":"20240612153128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱，初生名葱针，至夏，则有花。于秋月植，作高沟 ，旋壅起，以备冬用，曰冬葱，其实一也。又有龙角葱，每茎上出歧如角。皮赤者名楼葱，可煎汤，渫下部。子皆辛，黑色，有皱纹，作三瓣。此物大抵以发散为功，多食昏人神。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153112-6qy1rlb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153112-6qy1rlb"}},{"ID":"20240612153114-y0enpz4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153114-y0enpz4","updated":"20240612153118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱实《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153114-l8r2ohj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153114-l8r2ohj","updated":"20240612153114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主疗明目，补中不足。其茎葱白，平，可作汤，主伤寒，寒热，出汗，中痛，喉痹不通，安胎，归目，除肝邪气，安中，利五脏，益目精，杀百药毒。葱根，主伤寒头痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153114-z5lwzfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153114-z5lwzfg","updated":"20240612153114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱汁，平，温。主溺血，解藜芦毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153114-mvfnquq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153114-mvfnquq","updated":"20240612153114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕葱有数种，山葱曰 葱，疗病似胡葱，主诸恶 ，狐尿刺毒，山溪中沙虱，射工亦兼小蒜、茱萸辈，不独用也。其人间食葱，又有二种∶有冻葱，即经冬不死，分茎栽莳而无子；又有汉葱，冬则叶枯。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153114-0ms31cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153114-0ms31cu","updated":"20240612153114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食用入药，冻葱最善，气味亦佳也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153055-gszhyhq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153055-gszhyhq"}},{"ID":"20240612153056-yipdgdk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153056-yipdgdk","updated":"20240612153104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱实《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153056-h5q5l6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153056-h5q5l6w","updated":"20240612153056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。主明目。补中不足。其茎可作汤。主伤寒寒热出汗中风面目肿。。味辛温。主金创。创败。轻身不饥耐老。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153056-ig28cul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153056-ig28cul","updated":"20240612153056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脂膏相润。切实醯柔。鹿胎白洁。龙角青浮。强宗霆击。实政风流。金银蕴实本末捐投。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153056-8rfgp56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153056-8rfgp56","updated":"20240612153056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"礼。脂用葱。膏用。又。切葱若。实诸醯以柔之。李时珍曰。一名鹿胎葱。苏颂曰。一名龙角葱。后汉书传。庞参曰。拔大本薤者。欲吾击强宗也。蔡邕碑。讨恶如霆击。晋书传。庾亮啖薤留曰以种。陶侃叹曰。非惟风流。兼有为政之实。酉阳杂俎。山上有葱。下有银。山上有薤。下有金。礼。为君子择葱。则绝其本末。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152838-w6jpauo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612152838-w6jpauo"}},{"ID":"20240612152918-cayqxpv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612152918-cayqxpv","updated":"20240612152924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱实《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240612152918-jlhs356","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152918-jlhs356","updated":"20240612152918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主明目，补中不足。其茎葱白，平。可作汤，主伤寒寒热出汗，中风面目肿，伤寒骨肉痛，喉痹不通，安胎，归目，除肝邪气，安中，利五脏，益目睛，杀百药毒。葱根∶主伤寒头痛。葱汁∶平、温。主溺血。解藜芦毒。孟诜云∶葱根主疮中有水，风肿疼痛者冬葱最善。日华子云∶葱，治天行时疾，头痛热狂，通大小肠，霍乱转筋及奔豚气，香港脚，心腹痛，目眩，及止心迷闷。取其茎叶用盐研， 蛇虫伤，并金疮。水入皲肿，煨研敷。中射工溪毒，盐研 敷。子∶温中，补不足，益精明目。根∶杀一切鱼肉毒。不可以蜜同食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152838-rhnw3z6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612152838-rhnw3z6"}},{"ID":"20240612152903-guh982u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612152903-guh982u","updated":"20240612152911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱实《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612152903-p3edyc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152903-p3edyc7","updated":"20240612152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主明目，补中不足。其茎葱白，平，可作汤，主伤寒，寒热，出汗，中风，面目肿，伤寒骨肉痛，喉痹不通，安胎，归目，除肝邪气，安中，利五脏，益目睛，杀百药毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152903-r8nq243","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152903-r8nq243","updated":"20240612152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"葱根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主伤寒头痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152903-twh4fym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152903-twh4fym","updated":"20240612152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"葱汁"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平，温。主溺血，解藜芦毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152903-bngevcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152903-bngevcj","updated":"20240612152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本注云∶葱有数种，山葱曰 葱，疗病以胡葱，主诸恶 （七吏切），狐尿刺毒，山溪中沙虱、射工等毒。煮汁浸或捣敷大效，亦兼小蒜、茱萸辈，不独用也。其人间食葱，又有二种∶有冻葱，即经冬不死，分茎栽莳而无子也；又有汉葱，冬即叶枯。食用入药，冻葱最善，气味亦佳。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶葱有冬葱、汉葱、胡葱、 、葱凡四种。冬葱夏衰冬盛，茎叶俱软美。山南、江左有之。汉葱冬枯，其茎实硬而味薄。胡葱茎叶粗短，根若金，能疗肿毒。 葱生于山谷，不入药用。尔雅云∶ ，山葱。释曰∶《说文》云∶葱生山中者名 ，细茎大叶者是也。孟诜云∶葱，温。根主疮中有水，风肿疼痛者。冬葱最善，宜冬者，多食发气，上冲人，五脏闭绝，虚人胃。开骨节，出汗，故温尔。日华子云∶葱，治天行时疾，头痛，热狂，通大小肠，霍乱转筋及贲豚气，香港脚，心腹痛，目眩及止心迷闷。取其茎叶，用盐研， 蛇虫伤并金疮。水入皲肿，煨研 敷。中射工溪毒，盐研 敷。子，温中，补不足，益精，明目。根，杀一切鱼肉毒，不可以蜜同食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152903-k4sgowc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152903-k4sgowc","updated":"20240612152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶葱实，《本经》不载所出州土，今处处有之。葱有数种∶入药用山葱、胡葱；食品用冻葱、汉葱。山葱生山中，细茎大叶，食之香美于常葱。一名 （古百切）葱。《尔雅》所谓而根茎皆细白。又云∶茎叶微短如金灯者是也。旧别有条云∶生蜀郡山谷，似大蒜而小，形圆皮赤，稍长而锐。冻葱，冬夏常有，但分茎栽莳而无子，气味最佳，亦入药用，一名冬葱。又有一种楼葱，亦冬葱类也，江南人呼龙角葱，言其苗有八角，故云尔。淮、楚间多种之。汉葱茎实硬而味薄，冬即叶枯。凡葱皆能杀鱼肉毒，食品所不可缺也。唐·韦宙《独行方》主水病两足肿者，锉葱叶及茎，煮令烂，渍之，日三、五作乃佳。煨葱治打扑损，见刘禹锡《传信方》，云得于崔给事，取葱新折者，便入 灰火煨，趁将损处。仍多煨，取续续易热者。崔云∶顷在泽潞，与李抱真作球子，其军将以杖相格，便乘势不能止，因伤李相指并爪甲擘裂，遽索金创药裹之，强坐，频索酒吃，至数盏已过量，而面色愈青，忍痛不止。有军吏言此方遂用之，三易，面色却赤，斯须云已不痛。凡十数度用热葱并涕缠裹其指，遂毕席笑语。又上方》，治脾心痛，痛则腹胀如锥刀刺者。吴茱萸一升，葱花一食疗∶叶，温。白，平。主伤寒壮热，出汗，中风，面目浮肿，骨节头疼，损发鬓。葱白及须，平。通气，主伤寒头痛。又，治疮中有风水，肿疼。取青叶、干姜、黄柏相和，煮作汤，不宜多，只可和五味用之，上冲人，五脏闭绝。虚人患气者，多食发气。为通和关节，出汗之故也。少食则得，可作汤饮。不得多食，恐拔气上冲人，五脏闷绝。切不得与蜜相和，食之促人气，杀人。又，止血衄，利小便。外台秘要∶治肠痔，大便常血。取葱白三、五斤，煮作汤，盆中坐，立瘥。又方∶治大小肠不通。捣葱白以酢和，封小肾肿。泥葱半斤煨过，烂捣贴脐上。千金方∶治中恶，葱心黄刺脑骨破及骨折。葱白细研和蜜，浓封损处，立瘥。经验方∶治小便淋以艾灸七壮。梅师方∶治胎动不安，以银器煮上，即血止。又方∶后烦躁，卧不安稳。葱白二十茎，大枣二十枚，以水三升，煎取二升，分服。孙真人食忌正月游风。若烧葱和蜜食，杀人。食医心镜∶主赤白痢。以葱一握细切，和米煮粥，空心食之。又方∶理眼暗，补不足。葱实大半升为末，每度取一匙头，水二升煮取一升半，滤取滓，葺米煮粥食，良久食之。又捣葱实，丸蜜和，如梧子大，食后饮汁服一、亦甚明目。又方∶主伤寒寒热，骨节碎痛，出汗。治中风，面目浮肿，喉咽不通，安胎，归目，除肝脏邪气，安中，利五脏，益目睛，杀百药。叶作羹粥，炸作齑食之，良。胜金方∶治鼻衄血。以葱白一握，捣裂汁，投酒少许，抄三、两滴入鼻内，瘥。兵部手集∶治蜘蛛啮，遍身成疮。青葱叶一茎，去小条入葱叶中，紧捏两头，勿令通气，但摇动，即化为水，点咬处，即差葱须阴干为末，蒲州胆矾一钱，葱末二钱，研匀一字，入竹管中，吹病处。伤寒类要∶治妇人妊娠七月，若伤寒壮热，赤斑变为黑斑，溺血。以葱一把，水三升，令尽。杨氏产乳∶主胎动，五、六个月，困笃难较者。葱白一大握，滓顿服。又方∶主胎动，腰痛抢心，或下血。取葱白不限多少，浓煮汁伯，虽臭而有用，消金、玉、锡、石也。又以冬银、青石，各三分矣。曝令干如饴，可休粮，久服神仙，亦曰金浆也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152903-7ogyccn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152903-7ogyccn","updated":"20240612152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶葱实，葱初生名葱针，至夏则有花。于秋月植，作高沟 ，旋壅起，以备冬用，曰冬葱，其实一也。又有龙角葱，每茎上出歧如角。皮赤者名楼葱，可煎汤渫下部。子皆辛，色物大抵以发散为功，多食昏人神。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152838-rc2fmtm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612152838-rc2fmtm"}},{"ID":"20240612152851-b6atrdj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612152851-b6atrdj","updated":"20240612152856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱实《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612152851-loibq6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152851-loibq6m","updated":"20240612152851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．葱白，平．主治寒伤，骨肉痛，喉痹不通，安胎，归目，除肝邪气，安中，利脏，益目精，杀百药毒．葱根，主治伤寒头痛．葱汁，平，温．主溺血，解藜芦毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240612152851-egaxick","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152851-egaxick","updated":"20240612152851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶葱实，味辛，温．主明目，补中不足．其茎，可作汤，主伤寒寒热，出汗，中风面目肿．"}]},{"ID":"20240612153216-za5z1he","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153216-za5z1he"}},{"ID":"20240612153217-7sbix3l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153217-7sbix3l","updated":"20240612153223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱白《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153217-hsssy2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153217-hsssy2d","updated":"20240612153217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气温，味辛。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153217-by0as1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153217-by0as1c","updated":"20240612153217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入手太阴经、足阳明经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153217-fszse69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153217-fszse69","updated":"20240612153217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《液》云∶以通上下之阳也。《活人书》∶伤寒头痛如破，连须葱白汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153217-po43tvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153217-po43tvj","updated":"20240612153217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《心》云∶通阳气，辛而甘，气浓味薄，阳也。发散风邪。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153217-jrn6tlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153217-jrn6tlq","updated":"20240612153217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶葱实，主明目，补中不足。其茎白，平。可作汤，主伤寒寒热，出汗，中风，面目肿，伤寒骨肉痛，喉痹不通；安胎，归目，除肝邪气；安中，利五脏，益目精，杀百药毒。葱根，主伤寒头痛。葱汁，平温，主溺血，解藜芦毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153200-wmxwemq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153200-wmxwemq"}},{"ID":"20240612153201-5dozbrm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153201-5dozbrm","updated":"20240612153205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱白《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153201-oaiedry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153201-oaiedry","updated":"20240612153201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】葱实。味辛温。主明目补中不足，其茎可作汤，主伤寒寒热，出汗，中风面目肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153201-ikyo4zv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153201-ikyo4zv","updated":"20240612153201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，气温，入手太阴肺经。回脏腑之利泄，起经脉之芤减，发达皮毛，宣扬郁遏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153201-uvqc0x9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153201-uvqc0x9","updated":"20240612153201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《伤寒》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白通汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"葱白四茎，干姜一两，生附子一枚。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治少阴病，下利。以寒水侮土，清气下陷，而为泄利，姜、附温水土之寒，葱白升清气之陷也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153201-wk8g0en","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153201-wk8g0en","updated":"20240612153201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"通脉四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在甘草。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治少阴病，下利脉微，面色赤者，加葱九茎。以阳郁不能外达，故面赤，加葱白以宣阳气之郁也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153201-yuggtg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153201-yuggtg9","updated":"20240612153201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆花汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在旋覆花。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治妇人脉体芤减，用之以通经气之郁涩也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153201-bu19t15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153201-bu19t15","updated":"20240612153201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱白辛温发散，升陷达郁，行经发表，厥有功焉。其诸主治，下乳汁，散乳痈，消肿痛，止麻痹，疗下血，熨便癃，通淋涩，调泄利。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152838-rraukoh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612152838-rraukoh"}},{"ID":"20240612152839-l513st7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-l513st7","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：葱实"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-uipi1ti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-uipi1ti","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-mp4h8gp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-mp4h8gp","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cōnɡ Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-jn3clrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-jn3clrb","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-c4k21bb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-c4k21bb","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 葱子（《日华子本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-0g9at3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-0g9at3t","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-02gi0k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-02gi0k6","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-dzxu1ci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-dzxu1ci","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-3oh72dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-3oh72dl","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为百合种植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"葱"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"种子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋收集成熟果实，晒干，搓取种子，簸去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-i1n67nk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-i1n67nk","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-5da1mt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-5da1mt2","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国各地皆产。山东产量最大。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-5dh50jq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-5dh50jq","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-439nx4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-439nx4x","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥种子类三角状卵形，一面微凹入，一面隆起，隆起面有1～2条棱线。长2.5～3毫米，宽1.5～2毫米。表面黑色，光滑，下端有两个小突起，一为种脐，一为珠孔。内有白色种仁，富油性。气特臭，味如葱，以饱满、色黑、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-i17xsa4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-i17xsa4","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-eemjo1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-eemjo1z","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-ei52w56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-ei52w56","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"辛，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-l4kq19d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-l4kq19d","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《品汇精要》：\"味辛，性温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-qhjssk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-qhjssk3","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-nv92oks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-nv92oks","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 温肾，明目。治阳痿，目眩。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-1ofodcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-1ofodcg","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主明目，补中不足。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-8ulhdca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-8ulhdca","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经集注》：\"解藜芦毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-jr2uea0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-jr2uea0","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《中药志》：\"治肾虚阳痿，目眩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-93agc6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-93agc6d","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-kk85p4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-kk85p4s","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治眼暗，补不足：㈠葱实大半升，为末，每度取一匙头，水二升，煮取一升半，滤取滓，茸米煮粥食。㈡捣葱实和蜜丸如梧子大。食后，饮汁服一、二十丸，日二、三服。（《食医心镜》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-zlxx2ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-zlxx2ki","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疔：蜂蜜一两，葱心七个，同熬，滴水成珠，摊绢帛上贴。（《本草原始》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-9qm4h4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-9qm4h4i","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-py0ufrp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-py0ufrp","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-ugnkmch","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-ugnkmch","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：葱实"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-5eryg1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-5eryg1g","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-hwkh77i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-hwkh77i","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cōnɡ Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-z6xxhyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-z6xxhyf","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-hpmz93x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-hpmz93x","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 葱子"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-3nuel45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-3nuel45","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-a0if4v7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-a0if4v7","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Seed of Fistular Onion"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-zmo45qr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-zmo45qr","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-nymy19a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-nymy19a","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-i91ffxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-i91ffxt","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-xqrb3ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-xqrb3ao","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为百合科植物葱的种子。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-9im1ay9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-9im1ay9","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Allium fistulosum L."}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-tmby3zb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-tmby3zb","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋季采收果实，晒干，搓取种子，簸去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-nbg6y6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-nbg6y6h","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-afou4mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-afou4mp","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国各地均有栽植。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-s4h7v0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-s4h7v0z","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-s8ow3zf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-s8ow3zf","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 葱，多年生草本，高可达50cm。通常簇生、全体具辛臭，折断后有辛味之粘液。须根丛生，白色。鳞茎圆柱形，先端稍肥大，鳞叶成层，白色，上具白色纵纹。叶基生，圆柱形，中空，长约45cm，径1.5-2cm，先端尖，绿色，具纵纹；叶鞘浅绿色。花茎自叶丛抽出，通常单一，中央部膨大，中空，绿色，亦有纵纹；伞形花序圆球状；总苞膜质，卵形或卯状披针形；花被6，披针形，白色，外轮3枚较短小，内轮3枚较长大，花被片中央有一条纵脉；雄蕊6，花丝伸出，花药黄色，丁字着生；子房3室。蒴果三棱形。种子黑色，三角状半圆形，花期7-9月。果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-9zl3vsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-9zl3vsp","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-w4pb88l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-w4pb88l","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，种子三角状扁卵形，一面微凹，另面隆起，有棱线1-2条，长3-4mm，宽2-3mm。表面黑色，多光滑或偶有疏皱纹，凹面平滑。基部有两个突起，较短的突起先端灰棕色或灰白色，为种脐，较长的突起先端为珠孔。纵切面可见种皮菲薄，胚乳灰白色，胚白色，弯曲，子叶1枚。体轻，质坚硬。气特异嚼之有葱味。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-m7f7op2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-m7f7op2","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以粒饱满，色黑，无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-6eea2m1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-6eea2m1","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别，种子横切面：种皮表上以细胞外壁外突起，细胞壁厚，被有薄角质层，细胞腔含暗褐色造壁物质，其下为数裂棕黄色薄壁细胞。胚乳细胞形大，壁甚厚，有大形纹孔，细胞腔中含有糊粉粒及脂肪油。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-zan8gfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-zan8gfl","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特片：灰黑色，种皮表皮细胞黑色，长条形、多角形、类圆形或不规则形，直径18-37-74-130μm，表面具网状纹理。胚乳细胞众多，多破碎，有较多大的类圆形或长圆形纹孔。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-dtxv2ic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-dtxv2ic","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-4ooyjwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-4ooyjwp","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味辛；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-iwrihgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-iwrihgz","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-pe45a4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-pe45a4e","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 温肾；明目；解毒。主肾虚阳毒；遗精；目眩；视物昏暗；疮痈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-9wd2ara","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-9wd2ara","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-v8grtdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-v8grtdh","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，6-12g；或入丸散，煮粥。外用：知量，熬膏敷贴，煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-fsl7qx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-fsl7qx9","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-qjwhati","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-qjwhati","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治眼暗，补不足： 一、葱实大半升，为末。每度取一匙头，水二升，煮取一升半，滤取滓，葺米煮粥食。二、捣葱实和蜜丸如梧子大。食后，饮汁服一、二十丸， 日二、三服。 (《食医心镜》)②治疗： 蜂蜜一两，葱心七个，同熬，滴水成珠，摊绢帛上贴。 (《本草原始》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-y7wt74q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-y7wt74q","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-pufjwi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-pufjwi9","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主明目，补中不足。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-s426hn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-s426hn0","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经集注》：解藜芦毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-9n5niie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-9n5niie","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《中药志》：治肾虚阳痿，目眩。"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-6g5l81o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-6g5l81o","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612152839-eyf0xbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152839-eyf0xbo","updated":"20240612152839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612152840-c7fmujj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612152840-c7fmujj"}},{"ID":"20240612152841-l4szbrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612152841-l4szbrx"}}]}